  "solution": "The pattern followed here is:\n\n⇒ 5 × 2 - 1 = 9 \n\n⇒ 9 × 2 + 3 = 21\n\n**(3 - (-1)) = 4 **\n\n⇒ 21 × 2 + 1 = 43\n\n⇒ 43 × 2 + 5 = 91\n\n**(5 - 1) = 4 **\n\n⇒ 91 × 2 + 3 = 185\n\n⇒ 185 × 2 + 7 = 377\n\n**(7 - 3) = 4**\n\nSo the value of '**?**' is** 377**.\n\n**Hence, 'option 3' is the correct answer.**",
